WEBVTT

00:09:29.916 --> 00:09:31.956
so I'm going to score myself a minus one.

00:09:32.596 --> 00:09:34.516
And finally, Purpose.

00:09:34.516 --> 00:09:37.036
Purpose is about the impact
you want to have

00:09:37.076 --> 00:09:39.316
and the legacy you want to leave behind.

00:09:39.356 --> 00:09:42.356
It's the why you do what you do.

00:09:42.396 --> 00:09:44.556
For this, I score myself a zero.

00:09:45.356 --> 00:09:48.396
Now, I can already tell
the keen beans in the room and online

00:09:48.396 --> 00:09:50.436
are trying to add this up
and net this off.

00:09:50.436 --> 00:09:52.116
That is not how it works.

00:09:52.636 --> 00:09:54.956
Your positive impacts in one category

00:09:54.996 --> 00:09:58.076
doesn't mitigate your negative impacts
in another category.

00:09:58.436 --> 00:10:01.236
For me, the fact
that I'm financially well off